Z||000000||Pyro||03-18-2000||06:58 PM||||I was wondering if any of you knew of a kit to change the stock pop-up lights to flush glass-covered ones.  I was originally going to see if there was a way to fit 300ZX headlights with some bodywork.  First I want to see what other options are out there, and how hard they each are.  Somewhere I saw a site where someone used Geo Storm lights for his conversion.  I've also heard last-generation Camaro lights would work & I also heard of a purpose-built kit.  If any one has info to share, I'd appreciate it.  Thanks||||reg||5
